# Intermediate Teamwork (sandoria 64): Vilatroire in West Ronfaure. Introduction to Teamwork completed by GM (its
# completion needs a party). A WAR 10 at fame 124 (level 2): 132 (replaceDefault, over his default 136); a trade while
# available: nothing; fame 125 (level 3): 133 declined (nothing), 133 taken (begun); accepted, alone: the trigger
# returns nil, so his default 136; a trade: nothing. 129 (and its update and finish) starts only in a party of two or
# more: the #party flows take it. Introduction to Teamwork, completed, has no section. Vilatroire has no script; his
# default is 136.
lists WestRonfaure/Vilatroire/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/133 WestRonfaure/onEventUpdate/129 WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/129
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.4,-71,423.4 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 124
quest Sandoria.IntroductionToTeamwork completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Vilatroire                        # Introduction completed, fame level 2: 132 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Vilatroire BoneChip x1              # available: no trade handler, no script: nothing
fame Sandoria 125
trigger Vilatroire                        # fame level 3, level 10: 133
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Vilatroire                        # 133
finish option=1                           # begun
trigger Vilatroire                        # accepted, alone (#party 1): nil; his default 136
finish
trade Vilatroire BoneChip x1              # accepted: no trade handler: nothing
